{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39585","headline":"天佑元年以右拾遗使册闽王而作 · 翁承赞","name":"天佑元年以右拾遗使册闽王而作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬莱宫阙晓光匀，红案舁麻降紫宸。\n鸾奏八音谐律吕，凤衔五色显丝纶。\n萧何相印钧衡重，韩信斋坛雨露新。\n得侍丹墀官异宠，此身何幸沐恩频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}